    "title": "Registration is open for Albany Museum of Art kids holiday workshops - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brielle Batchelor ,\n1 days ago ALBANY, Ga. (WALB) -The Albany Museum of Art’s Kids Holiday Workshops were made for children and preteens to welcome in and celebrate the holiday season. “These are always fun art experiences for our young artists,” AMA Director of Education and Public Programming Annie Van Oteghem said. “Exploring color and different media has a way of brightening up the short winter days.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
